WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.678
Step 1. Find the Product Knowledge.

1.2
00:00:02.678 --> 00:00:06.980
In Settings, in the Inventory group, select Product Knowledge,

1.3
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.506
and open its category.

1.4
00:00:08.506 --> 00:00:13.793
To find Draft or Retired Product Knowledge, change the Status filter.

2.1
00:00:13.793 --> 00:00:18.415
Step 2. Open the Product Knowledge. Select View on its row.

2.2
00:00:18.415 --> 00:00:23.601
The page shows the details in the Overview, Names, Storage Guidelines,

2.3
00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:26.250
and Product Definition cards.

3.1
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.284
Step 3. Update the details. Select Edit, change the fields, and select Update.

3.2
00:00:32.284 --> 00:00:35.992
Update stays unavailable until you change a field.

3.3
00:00:35.992 --> 00:00:40.126
If you change the Slug, the page address changes.

4.1
00:00:40.126 --> 00:00:45.346
Step 4. Retire the Product Knowledge. Select Delete, then Confirm.

4.2
00:00:45.346 --> 00:00:47.304
Delete does not remove it.

4.3
00:00:47.304 --> 00:00:52.624
Care sets the status to Retired, and pickers no longer offer it.
